Error [jet.InvalidGuardMap]: `SharedGuard.map` needs a stored field projection
  --> tests/ui/shared_guard_computed_map.jet:9:18
    |
  9 |     _: guard.map(fn(value) { value.attack })
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A projected guard must keep a stable stored place inside the value protected by the original lock; computed fields are values, not places
 Fix: Write a direct projection such as `guard.map(fn(value) { value.field })`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0215
